    description=(
        "Creates Wall elements based on the given parameters. Takes the same wall settings as ModifyWalls, applied by "
        "the same code, including geometryType (Straight or Trapezoid, with begThickness and endThickness), "
        "profileType (Normal, Slanted or Trapez) and the slant angles, so a trapezoid or slanted wall is made in one "
        "call; only bottomOffset differs, which comes from zCoordinate. A slantAlpha or slantBeta that the wall's "
        "profileType cannot take fails the item instead of being dropped. Neither command can write a Polygonal "
        "outline (it needs an outline polygon, which these commands do not take), connectionPriority or "
        "junctionSequence (Archicad ignores writes to them; GetDetailsOfElements reads them), and on Archicad 29 any "
        "story visibility other than 'Home story only' and 'All relevant stories'."
    ),
